title: NPC_Start
---
<<if quest_status("deer_01") == "NotStarted">>
    NPC: Hello newbie.
    NPC: Can you go take a picture of deer for me?
    -> Yeah.
        <<start_quest "deer_01">>
        NPC: Thank you.
    -> Maybe next time.
        NPC: Okay i'll wait.
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "Active" && has_photo("deer_01")>>
    NPC: Meet the deer tell me about it
    <<complete_quest "deer_01">>
    NPC: Thank you very much this will help our research alot.
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "Active">>
    NPC: Not found yet? maybe check around the lake.
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "Completed">>
    NPC: Oh i see you get the deer. Thank for your service.
<<endif>>
===
